OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'traumatised' after tree
OL,4,Afalls into garden
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarratt said it had not been made aware
OL,7,Fof concerns, but apologised for the
OL,8,Fdisruption and said the tree had been
OL,9,Fremoved. FirstPort said it
OL,10,F"proactively" managed trees on the
OL,11,Fdevelopment through "a programme of
OL,12,Fregular inspections".
